/// This enum represents the different formats of credentials that can be used in the DCQL specification.
/// * W3C Verifiable Credentials: jwt_vc_json and ldp_vc
/// * AnonCreds: ac_vp
/// * mdocs: mso_mdoc
/// * IETF SD-JWT VC: dc+sd-jwt
///
